<title>GERMANY: VEW 9-month net profit up nine percent.</title>
<headline>VEW 9-month net profit up nine percent.</headline>
<dateline>DORTMUND, Germany 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30</p>
<p>    Group sales				  6,238   minus 1.2 pct</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   129     plus nine pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German electricity group is VEW AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
